[05:17:21] RETRY5 cartpole_xbench_seed0/1/2 (episodes=512, length=48) -- real root cause found and fixed: CartpoleDMControlWrapper.compile_model() (stable_worldmodel/envs/dmcontrol/cartpole.py) reassigned self.env on every reset (physics variation triggers a recompile almost every reset) without closing the old env first, leaking a GL/EGL render context each time. Fixed with one line (self.env.close() before reassignment). What looked like crashes/hangs was this leak plus render contention from the 11 other MUJOCO_GL=egl processes already running (PushT + Fetch matrix) -- a solo episode took up to 68s to acquire a context under that load, well past the old 45s timeout. batch_size=8, batch_timeout=900s to accommodate.
